    "Data: priority 1 (Turner et al. bad medical advice) was located in about one minute, but its archive's tos.txt forbids including the dataset in any AI model's training corpus and says that use means agreement; the runner did not accept those terms on Evan's behalf and used priority 2, Betley et al.'s insecure.jsonl (MIT). See results/data.json.",
